validate/effective_size.jl branch — part 1b: does drift_critical_rate find every steady state?
old = the function at d8b2565 (copied in effective_size_parts.jl); new = drift_critical_rate(p; solver = :bisection) (ne = :falconer);
the default, solver = :iteration, is compared with old bitwise in section 3.
all states = an independent maximum over the steady states parametrised by their variance (as eq. 6 of Xu and Shen 2026 is).

